OL,3,GNEWSAPaul Merton show halted by theatre
OL,4,Aroof leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Merton has pledged his support for
OL,7,Fa Victorian theatre after a leak in its
OL,8,Froof forced his show to be abandoned.
OL,10,FThe comedian was on stage at the
OL,11,FTheatre Royal Portsmouth with his wife
OL,12,Fand on-stage comedy partner Suki
OL,13,FWebster on Wednesday evening when water
OL,14,Fstarted coming through the roof above
OL,15,Fthe audience following heavy rain.
OL,17,FThe theatre said the condition of the
OL,18,Froof was a known issue and work had
OL,19,Falready begun on a long-term repair. It
OL,20,Fsaid shows at the venue would continue
OL,21,Fas scheduled.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
